  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>of</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>products</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>of</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>reactants</mi></math><br /><br />The equation for two deuterons combining to form Helium nucleus is given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Energy</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>released</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mtext>1.1</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>4.4</mtext></math></p><p>The energy released in this process is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mtext>23.6</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math></p>",
